{
  "server": "en",
  "storyId": "story_peper_set_1_story_1",
  "groupId": "story_peper_set_1",
  "stageId": null,
  "title": "Mercenary Youth",
  "storyCode": null,
  "avgTag": "Interlude",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/en/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_peper_1_1.txt",
  "sourceHash": "22fbd18abd50f6ae6b6e40160ba9d080325a780bf5ff06438e9fb20974f0c60e",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mercenary Captain",
      "text": "How's she doing?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sarkaz Mercenary",
      "text": "She's still here, following along.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sarkaz Mercenary",
      "text": "You know what a stubborn runt she is.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mercenary Captain",
      "text": "Try to talk to her again...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sarkaz Mercenary",
      "text": "Damn it, Grimm, you're going senile, aren't you?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sarkaz Mercenary",
      "text": "If you're going to regret it now, why did you even bring her here?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grimm",
      "text": "Cut the crap.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grimm",
      "text": "We were in sticky situation with that deal at the black market. Both of them moneybags wanted each other dead. And with the merch gone, they'd only blame us for the mess.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grimm",
      "text": "If we hadn't brought the kid with us, she would've died in the city.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sarkaz Mercenary",
      "text": "I know that, but now you're chasing her away, and she's got nowhere to go.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grimm",
      "text": "Just gotta find her a random town... As long as there's work, there's still a way out for her.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sarkaz Mercenary",
      "text": "You really believe that?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sarkaz Mercenary",
      "text": "I mean it. For her sake, you should just train her. Has she ever seen blood? I mean real blood, not a couple hornbeasts getting slaughtered.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grimm",
      "text": "...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sarkaz Mercenary",
      "text": "Grimm, enough daydreaming. We're already on our way to Londinium. We'll run into more clashes.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sarkaz Mercenary",
      "text": "And she's a Sarkaz.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grimm",
      "text": "Yeah. Shut up already.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grimm",
      "text": "I know what to do with her.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Paprika",
      "text": "Jerk, jerk... you great big jerk...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Paprika",
      "text": "Treating me like a kid again... I'll make you regret this someday!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sarkaz Mercenary",
      "text": "Hey.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Paprika",
      "text": "—! A raid?!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sarkaz Mercenary",
      "text": "If this was a raid, you'd be dead already.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Paprika",
      "text": "Oh... what? Don't scare me like that.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sarkaz Mercenary",
      "text": "I don't have time to come scare you. You're scaring yourself, not being alert enough.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Paprika",
      "text": "I'm a medic. I wasn't <i>that</i> good at fighting to begin with.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Paprika",
      "text": "Besides, I was... I was thinking about things. That's why I didn't notice.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sarkaz Mercenary",
      "text": "Fine, whatever you say.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sarkaz Mercenary",
      "text": "So? Still mad about Old Grimm?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Paprika",
      "text": "Hmph... Of course!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Paprika",
      "text": "He wanted me off the team <i>now?</i> Don't you think that's awful?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sarkaz Mercenary",
      "text": "Ugh.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Paprika",
      "text": "I'm a merc. I'm part of the team. Why'd he want me gone?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Paprika",
      "text": "Why doesn't he want me to come with you guys to Londinium? I've been on so many missions with you!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sarkaz Mercenary",
      "text": "This gig's different.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Paprika",
      "text": "I don't see what's so special about it... It's a bit far, but there's lots of money in it!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Paprika",
      "text": "If there's one thing that's not the same as usual...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Paprika",
      "text": "It's when Grimm came back that day and said we had to pack and leave right away. I'd never seen him so worked up.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Paprika",
      "text": "Usually, nothing matters to him, but not then. He even said that if we win this time, we'll have a much better future.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Paprika",
      "text": "Is that true?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sarkaz Mercenary",
      "text": "Who knows?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sarkaz Mercenary",
      "text": "I just want my money up front. The rest I haven't thought about.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Paprika",
      "text": "Eh, that's fair.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Paprika",
      "text": "Grimm thinks I don't know nothing, but what does it matter as long as we make money?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Paprika",
      "text": "As long as Nana doesn't go hungry, all gigs are the same. What else do I have to know?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Paprika",
      "text": "If we really get that much money... I want to buy Nana a better house. The place she's living in now has a leaky roof, and she keeps telling me her knees hurt.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Paprika",
      "text": "Oh, right. If Grimm wants one, I could even buy him a decent birthday present.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sarkaz Mercenary",
      "text": "You want to celebrate <i>his</i> birthday? Does he even remember something as pointless as his birthday?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Paprika",
      "text": "How is that pointless? It's like the opposite of pointless!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Paprika",
      "text": "If you don't remind yourself every year, you might just forget that a year has come and gone, that you've gotten a year bigger, a year older.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Paprika",
      "text": "Doesn't that sound scary to you?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sarkaz Mercenary",
      "text": "Kinda?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Paprika",
      "text": "What kind of lame answer is that?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sarkaz Mercenary",
      "text": "Fine, whatever you say.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sarkaz Mercenary",
      "text": "The way I see it, if you told Grimm himself what you just told me, he might just agree... No, he might even be less inclined to let you follow us.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Paprika",
      "text": "Huh? What's that mean...?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sarkaz Mercenary",
      "text": "(And I was going to convince her to leave...)",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sarkaz Mercenary",
      "text": "(Forget it.)",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sarkaz Mercenary",
      "text": "Never mind. Keep following, then. I'm heading back to the front.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Paprika",
      "text": "Sheesh, what's with that? I hate people who don't finish their thoughts.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Paprika",
      "text": "Acting all mysterious...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Paprika",
      "text": "...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The man has already walked away. There are roughly twenty men in the team up ahead. Paprika can only faintly make out the shadow of the last man in the group.\nThe girl stays quiet for a moment. She looks down and pulls something out of her pocket.\nA finger sleeve made of wool and bright in color."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Paprika",
      "text": "Grimm's definitely gonna say it looks too colorful.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Paprika",
      "text": "Well, what does it matter? It looks prettier when it's colorful.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Paprika",
      "text": "If he tells me to go away one more time...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Paprika",
      "text": "I won't give him his present!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Paprika",
      "text": "—!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Paprika",
      "text": "(What's that noise?)",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Paprika",
      "text": "(...)",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Paprika",
      "text": "(Was that just my imagination?)",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Paprika",
      "text": "...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Paprika",
      "text": "Who's there? Come out!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Paprika",
      "text": "Hmph!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "text": "——!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Paprika",
      "text": "Got you!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Paprika",
      "text": "Who are you? And what are you after?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Paprika",
      "text": "Hey, you—",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Paprika",
      "text": "Wait... Don't even think about it!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Paprika",
      "text": "Huff... hah...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Paprika",
      "text": "G-Got you...!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Black Market Brawler",
      "text": "I never expected a young lass like you would spot me.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Paprika",
      "text": "What does that make you? You got yourself caught by a young lass.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Paprika",
      "text": "You won't get away. Now spill it! Who are you?!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Black Market Brawler",
      "text": "Hah, what a naive kid. I'll admit you're not half bad. The Sarkaz really live up to their reputation.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Black Market Brawler",
      "text": "But you...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Black Market Brawler",
      "text": "It doesn't matter how good a naive, boneheaded kid fights. It doesn't change the fact that you're a kid.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Paprika",
      "text": "Why you...!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Paprika",
      "text": "(No, Paprika. He's provoking you on purpose... Don't fall for it. Calm down.)",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Paprika",
      "text": "I'm warning you. Don't you try to buy time with stupid stuff.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Paprika",
      "text": "Now answer my question, if you know what's good for you!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Black Market Brawler",
      "text": "...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Black Market Brawler",
      "text": "Here's a free lesson, Sarkaz punk.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Paprika",
      "text": "Answer me!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Black Market Brawler",
      "text": "If you know someone's stalling, you shouldn't hang around and let things drag out—",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Paprika",
      "text": "What? You...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Black Market Brawler B",
      "text": "Are you done yet?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Black Market Brawler B",
      "text": "Having a nice chat with your new girlfriend, are you?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Paprika",
      "text": "Shit! Y-You...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Black Market Brawler",
      "text": "—Do it!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Paprika",
      "text": "Dammit! You... crooked sons of bitches!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Paprika",
      "text": "(No, if both of them attack at once... I can't dodge!)",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Paprika",
      "text": "Ugh!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grimm",
      "text": "Eyes open! Look at your opponent. Raise your weapon and block!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Paprika",
      "text": "Ungh!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Black Market Brawler",
      "text": "Ugh, here comes the nasty bastard.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grimm",
      "text": "Don't worry about anyone else. Focus on your target.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grimm",
      "text": "Don't worry about getting hurt. In battle, never let go of your weapon!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Paprika",
      "text": "Yes, sir!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Black Market Brawler B",
      "text": "Don't you underestimate me!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grimm",
      "text": "Now! Attack!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Paprika",
      "text": "Haah!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Black Market Brawler",
      "text": "Gah!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Paprika",
      "text": "Hah... Haah! Don't underestimate you?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Paprika",
      "text": "Right back at you—You jerks. Don't—Don't underestimate me!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Black Market Brawler B",
      "text": "Hah, where're you aiming at, punk?!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grimm",
      "text": "What are you doing?!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grimm",
      "text": "Have you forgotten everything I've taught you?! Aim for his vitals!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Paprika",
      "text": "I-I know...!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Paprika",
      "text": "Haaaaagh—!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Paprika",
      "text": "*pant*... *pant*...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Paprika",
      "text": "*pant*...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Paprika",
      "text": "Got them.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Paprika",
      "text": "Grimm!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Paprika",
      "text": "You see that? I took them both down myself!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grimm",
      "text": "...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Paprika",
      "text": "Grimm...?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Paprika",
      "text": "What's wrong? A-Are you mad?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grimm",
      "text": "What did I teach you before?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Paprika",
      "text": "Don't underestimate the enemy, don't hold back, and aim for the enemy's vitals in one go.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grimm",
      "text": "And what were you doing?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Paprika",
      "text": "I... I didn't miss on purpose. I... uh...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Paprika",
      "text": "I mean, you're here. It's not a problem.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grimm",
      "text": "...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grimm",
      "text": "What if... in the future, I'm not around?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Paprika",
      "text": "But why would you ever not be around?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grimm",
      "text": "No one sticks around forever. Don't be stupid.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Black Market Brawler",
      "text": "Ugh...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grimm",
      "text": "They're still alive?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Paprika",
      "text": "Uh... yeah. I-I knocked them out...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grimm",
      "text": "Why didn't you kill them outright?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Paprika",
      "text": "Well...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Paprika",
      "text": "That's not really necessary, right...?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Paprika",
      "text": "Hey, how about I tie them up?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Paprika",
      "text": "That way, they can't call for help...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grimm",
      "text": "...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grimm",
      "text": "Paprika.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Paprika",
      "text": "Hm?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grimm",
      "text": "Watch carefully.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The old mercenary unsheathes the sharp blade he is carrying at his waist and drives it into the defeated man's throats as the young girl watches.\nHis red blood spatters onto Paprika's knees and her shoes; the scalding heat seeps through the fabric and reaches her skin."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Paprika",
      "text": "But... Why...?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grimm",
      "text": "They're from the black market, and they came for us.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grimm",
      "text": "If I hadn't noticed their movement just now, it could've been you who was lying on the ground here.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Paprika",
      "text": "I know!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Paprika",
      "text": "I know they were up to no good! And that if it wasn't for you, I would've been in danger...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Paprika",
      "text": "...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Paprika",
      "text": "There's one more. He's my quarry. I'll end him.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grimm",
      "text": "...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Paprika",
      "text": "...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Paprika",
      "text": "(I need to kill him... Right, I have to.)",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Paprika",
      "text": "(Just stab him. Relax, Paprika. This isn't hard...)",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Paprika",
      "text": "...Phew...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grimm",
      "text": "What are you hesitating for?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Paprika",
      "text": "I'm not...!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Paprika",
      "text": "(I'm not hesitating... I'm a merc. This is just killing... just killing my enemy!)",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Paprika",
      "text": "(What is there to hesitate about? I... I...)",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Paprika",
      "text": "I'll waste him right now... right now!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grimm",
      "text": "...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grimm",
      "text": "That's enough.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Paprika",
      "text": "What? But Grimm, I still haven't—",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grimm",
      "text": "You can't bring yourself to do it.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Paprika",
      "text": "No! Trust me... I can!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grimm",
      "text": "You still don't understand a thing.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grimm",
      "text": "If you can't even kill a man like him, I can say for sure there is no future for you as a merc.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grimm",
      "text": "You will die soon. Dying on a battlefield somewhere is still a half-decent outcome, but you could die somewhere that doesn't even matter, and I'd have to go collect your body.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Paprika",
      "text": "But I am a merc!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Paprika",
      "text": "All of us mercs will die one day. Didn't you say that yourself?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grimm",
      "text": "All of <i>us?</i>",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grimm",
      "text": "Hah, you're not one of us.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Paprika",
      "text": "What?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Paprika",
      "text": "Grimm, sometimes, I'm scared...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grimm",
      "text": "Of what?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Paprika",
      "text": "Just like you said, it could've been me who got killed here today. If it wasn't for you, I would've been killed for sure.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Paprika",
      "text": "It could take you guys a long time to find me, and then it'd take an even longer time for Nana back home to find out.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Paprika",
      "text": "That's what happened when Fred died. I still remember.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grimm",
      "text": "Death and parting are a normal part of life.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Paprika",
      "text": "Yeah... I know. You always say that.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Paprika",
      "text": "I'm not scared of dying. I really am not.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Paprika",
      "text": "But I'm scared of keeping Nana waiting for me to go home, even if I won't ever make it back.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grimm",
      "text": "...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grimm",
      "text": "I'll let you off this time.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Paprika",
      "text": "Grimm...! No, wait, I really can—",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grimm",
      "text": "I've seen enough of this charade. We're done here.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grimm",
      "text": "But, kid, remember this. If you follow us, sooner or later you will run into a situation where you gotta kill.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Paprika",
      "text": "Yeah... I get it...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grimm",
      "text": "Do you now? I don't see it.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grimm",
      "text": "This might end up killing you.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grimm",
      "text": "Paprika.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grimm",
      "text": "Don't go to Londinium. You're not cut out for it.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Paprika",
      "text": "But...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Paprika",
      "text": "Didn't you say that as long as we win this war, we'll have a better future?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Paprika",
      "text": "I can fight. I will definitely be helpful!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grimm",
      "text": "This is about more than just fighting.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grimm",
      "text": "I'm putting everything on the line for this mission. Because I've seen it before.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Paprika",
      "text": "Seen what before?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grimm",
      "text": "I've seen us Sarkaz with a home.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Paprika",
      "text": "Home...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grimm",
      "text": "Maybe it won't be all that good, but as long as there's a shred of hope, I'm willing to fight for it.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grimm",
      "text": "But you're different. You still have a choice.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Paprika",
      "text": "I... I have a choice?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Paprika",
      "text": "I don't know...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Paprika",
      "text": "Where else could I go, if I don't go with you?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Paprika",
      "text": "I want to head back to my hometown and live my days like before, but... can we really do that?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grimm",
      "text": "...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Paprika",
      "text": "I've thought about this before. This mission in Londinium will be harder than all the missions we've been on, right?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grimm",
      "text": "Maybe.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Paprika",
      "text": "One day, you might collapse on the ground somewhere and lose your life just like that.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grimm",
      "text": "Yeah.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Paprika",
      "text": "In that case, I'm not gonna prepare a birthday present ahead of time next year.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Paprika",
      "text": "Here. Your present for this year.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grimm",
      "text": "A finger glove?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Paprika",
      "text": "Don't you say it's too colorful, a waste of time, or that it's not something you need!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grimm",
      "text": "...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Paprika",
      "text": "I-I'm not gonna be sad if you die. I promise you. Death and parting is nothing to us Sarkaz.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Paprika",
      "text": "But if we can avoid dying... even if we get the living hell beaten out of us, even if we don't get paid...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Paprika",
      "text": "None of that matters. I won't even be bothered if we don't earn a single dime after this long trip!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Paprika",
      "text": "At the very least...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Paprika",
      "text": "I hope we'll all come back together after the mission is over.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grimm",
      "text": "How naive.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grimm",
      "text": "Are all young Sarkaz these days this naive? My kind of Sarkaz never think like that.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Paprika",
      "text": "Why are you digging at me again?!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Paprika",
      "text": "Can't Sarkaz wish for the people around them to be safe?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Paprika",
      "text": "That's really how I feel... and I'm a Sarkaz!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grimm",
      "text": "...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grimm",
      "text": "Sarkaz like you die on the battlefield.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grimm",
      "text": "And I'd rather not have your death on my conscience, kid.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grimm",
      "text": "Let's go.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Paprika",
      "text": "What's that supposed to mean...? Hey, wait for me!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
